    <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
         English localization (Phase 4)
         ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
         For non-Arabic-speaking BYD EV owners in the Arab world (expats,
         English-speaking visitors). The default locale (values/) remains
         vocalized Egyptian Arabic — the app's primary audience is Arabic
         speakers. This file provides English equivalents so the app is
         usable by English speakers too.

         Note: The voice assistant (wake word, ASR, TTS) is Egyptian Arabic
         only. English localization covers the UI text only — voice commands
         remain in Arabic.
         ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

