    <!-- Advanced Telemetry (enthusiast flavor only) -->
    <string name="advanced_telemetry_title">Advanced Telemetry (Experimental)</string>
    <string name="advanced_telemetry_warning_full">Advanced Telemetry is an unofficial experimental feature based on reverse-engineering of the car\'s internal Android services on the DiLink system. It is not supported or endorsed by BYD, may stop working after firmware updates, and may affect your vehicle warranty or BYD terms of service. Enable only if you understand and accept this.\n\nData collected: tyre pressure, HV bus voltage, 12V battery voltage, motor RPM, and battery cell voltage — read-only, and will not touch safety-critical systems like brakes, steering, or airbags.</string>
    <string name="advanced_telemetry_acknowledge">I have read and understand the warning and accept the risks</string>
